        "text_Ub47yL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-md",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-md",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-lg",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-lg",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-lg",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-lg",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Allergy sufferers need consistent, thorough air filtration. Pollen, dust mites, pet dander, and mold spores are common triggers that standard ventilation cannot adequately address.<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/collections/air-purifiers\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Blueair air purifiers</span></a> deliver powerful performance for various room sizes. Using advanced filtration technology, they remove allergens efficiently while operating quietly enough for bedroom use.</p><p>Benefits for allergy relief include rapid air circulation that refreshes room air multiple times per hour, particle sensors that automatically adjust filtration intensity, whisper-quiet operation for uninterrupted sleep, and activated carbon layers that neutralize odors and volatile organic compounds. </p><p>Models like<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-pure-311i-max\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">the Blue Pure 311i Max</span></a> handle medium-sized spaces up to 439 ft², while<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-pure-211i-max\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">the Blue Pure 211i Max</span></a> covers larger living areas up to 674 sq. ft.</p><p>For compact spaces like<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/blogs/news/blog-bedrooms\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bedrooms</span></a> or home offices,<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/collections/shop-all/small\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">smaller units</span></a> like<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-pure-511i-max\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">the Blue Pure 511i Max</span></a> provide effective filtration without taking up much floor space.</p><h3><strong>Best Air Filter for Homes with Asthma Patients</strong></h3>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "image_caption_7bGAwY": {
          "type": "image_caption",
          "settings": {
