        "text_RYVXj3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-md",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-md",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-lg",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-lg",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-lg",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-lg",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Asthma management requires eliminating triggers before they cause respiratory distress. Smoke particles, fine dust, and airborne irritants can provoke attacks even in controlled environments. </p><p>Reducing indoor particulate matter improves asthma control and respiratory function. Studies show that<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/blogs/news/medical-condition-air-purifier-help\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">using advanced air filters leads to measurable health improvements</span></a> for people with respiratory sensitivities.</p><p>Units with dual-intake design capture particles from both floor level and above, targeting the zones where dust and allergens concentrate most. Benefits for asthma management include continuous operation with minimal energy consumption, real-time air quality monitoring, automatic adjustment to changing air conditions, and quiet operation up to 67 percent quieter than traditional HEPA purifiers.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-pure-311i-plus-max\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">The Blue Pure 311i+ Max</span></a> includes technology that prevents bacterial growth on the filter between uses, an important feature for maintaining clean air when the unit isn't actively running.</p><h3><strong>Comparing Filtration Technologies</strong></h3>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "image_caption_kEPhwQ": {
          "type": "image_caption",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-0",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "1096px",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image3_7888812d-c0d5-410f-80a2-3fdf0dd7042e.jpg",
            "image_desktop": "shopify://shop_images/image3_7888812d-c0d5-410f-80a2-3fdf0dd7042e.jpg",
